# Repository-root ignore rules — SIGNING AND KEY MATERIAL ONLY (ALPHA-R1).
#
# Deliberately narrow: this file exists so that a keystore or a local signing
# properties file accidentally placed anywhere in the repository is ignored,
# not just inside `bismillah_app/`. Package-level ignores stay where they are
# (`bismillah_app/.gitignore`, `bismillah_app/android/.gitignore`,
# `functions/.gitignore`) — do not move general build/tooling rules here.
#
# Setup, backup and recovery: docs/setup/ANDROID_RELEASE_SIGNING.md
#
# NOTE: git-ignoring cannot un-track an already committed file. If key material
# is ever committed, the key must be treated as compromised and rotated.

# Android / Java keystores
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pepk

# Local signing configuration (the tracked template is `key.properties.example`)
key.properties
key.properties.local
